ts** — receives a **Rs 51.20 crore Letter of Acceptance from Southern Railway** for traffic/location surveys and DPR work on new BG line and doubling projects _(~15.1% of mcap)_.","**Magellanic Cloud** — wholly owned subsidiary Provigil Surveillance secures a **Rs 29.13 crore Letter of Acceptance from Northern Railway, Moradabad Division** for CCTV/e-surveillance at railway stations for Kumbh Mela 2027, due in 3 months plus a 5-year AMC _(mcap n/a)_.","**Newgen Software Technologies** — UK subsidiary signs a **GBP 1.63 million (~Rs 20.51 crore) document-management deal** with Just Retirement Management Services, a 3.5-year engagement _(mcap n/a)_.","**Dhabriya Polywood** — receives a **Rs 11.79 crore uPVC doors-and-windows work order** from Conscient Group, to be executed over 24 months _(~2.2% of mcap, our arithmetic)_.","**Siyaram Recycling Industries** — secures a **Rs 4.00 crore brass-billet export order from Green Metals FZCO, Dubai** _(~5.1% of mcap)_ — a second, smaller order from the same counterparty inside a week.","**B. L. Kashyap and Sons** — Bagging/Receiving of orders/contracts worth Rs 200.02 crore _(mcap n/a)_."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**Ujjivan Small Finance Bank** — board approves a **preferential issue of up to 6.32 crore equity shares at Rs 64.73** to International Finance Corporation, Bajaj Life Insurance, Aditya Birla Sun Life Insurance and HDFC Life Insurance, aggregating up to **Rs 409.04 crore**, subject to shareholder approval at the 13-Nov EGM.","**Regency Fincorp** — board approves a combined **preferential issue of equity shares (Rs 72.04 cr) and warrants (Rs 240.11 cr) to promoters and non-promoters, aggregating Rs 312.15 crore** _(~51.6% of mcap)_, subject to shareholder approval at an EGM."],"equity_allotments":["**Standard Engineering Technology** (formerly Standard Glass Lining) — allots 24,39,750 preferential equity shares at **Rs 293** (incl. Rs 283 premium) to AGI Group Holdings and Monoflus Pte Ltd, for **Rs 71.48 crore**, per its 10-Aug EGM approval.","**Affle 3i** — receipt of exercise request from promoter Affle Holdings Pte Ltd for conversion of warrants into equity shares."],"capex_core":["**Vraj Iron and Steel** — Addendum of Fresh Terms of Reference (ToR) for the Greenfield Steel Plant Project from MoEF&CC.","**Rockingdeals Circular Economy** — capacity addition with respect to organized retail grocery stores."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — **24 companies filed** results or earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**Dachepalli Publishers** — H1 FY27 revenue of **Rs 70.01 crore, up 71.76% YoY**; signs an MoU to acquire Hara Communications, subject to due diligence and definitive agreements.","**Novateor Research Laboratories** — enters an exclusive 3-year manufacturing-and-supply agreement with Pidilite Industries for enzyme-based Aligner Cleaning Foam and Tooth Brightening Strips; pricing not disclosed, set per purchase order.","**Onward Technologies** — Q2 FY27 revenue up 22.2% YoY to **Rs 171.2 crore**, EBITDA up 33.7%; separately secures a **multi-year contract renewal valued at Rs 44.46 crore**.","**Australian Premium Solar (India)** — commissions another 400 MW TOPCon module line, taking total module capacity to **1.2 GW** (+50%); FY26 consolidated income rose 60.7% to **Rs 708.74 crore**, PAT up 44.3% to Rs 57.87 crore."],"distress_risk":["**Tata Chemicals** — a Mumbai Centre for International Arbitration tribunal unanimously **rejects Allied Silica's Rs 908 crore claim**, directing Tata Chemicals to pay only a **Rs 1 crore** principal plus interest and costs (one member dissenting).","**Yes Bank** — Supreme Court upholds the Bombay High Court's setting-aside of the 2020 write-down of **Rs 8,415 crore of Additional Tier-1 Bonds**, dismissing the Bank's, RBI's and the Union's appeals; the Bank estimates reinstatement cuts CET1 by **~250 bps**.","**Refex Industries** — the Commissioner of Income Tax (Appeals), Chennai, partly allows its appeal on a reassessment for AY2014-15: deletes a **Rs 36.39 lakh** depreciation disallowance but remands a **Rs 17.48 crore** LTCG addition to the Assessing Officer for fresh quantification.","**Dharmaj Crop Guard** — orders passed by the High Court of Himachal Pradesh."],"credit_rating_changes":["**Kalpataru Projects International** — CRISIL upgrades long-term bank-facility and Rs 150 crore NCD ratings to **AA+/Stable** from AA/Stable, reaffirms short-term at A1+; withdraws the rating on a separate NCD series fully repaid."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","credit_rating_changes":"Credit-rating changes"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/VASCONEQ_16102026081542_16102026LetterofIntent_V1_Sd.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/6db824c0-5ac9-417b-97f2-ba42ee644f89.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/2679aa09-35d2-44bc-9024-ebe1a6b79762.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/950e90a4-1cfe-4258-a0ed-4a700a21dfdc.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/MCLOUD_16102026091534_Press_Release.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/NEWGEN2_16102026131011_Stock_Exchange_Material_disclosure_NewgenUKSIGN.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/4cafa297-059e-4bd7-9b21-35466d215f93.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfil